  description: 'Target any number of "Photon" monsters in your GY; Special Summon
    them, but their effects are negated. During your Main Phase: You can banish this
    card from your GY, then target 1 "Photon" monster your opponent controls; take
    control of it, and if you do, its ATK for the rest of this turn becomes the combined
    original ATK of all "Photon" monsters you currently control, also you cannot
    declare attacks this turn, except with that monster. You can only use each effect
    of "Eternal Bond" once per turn.'
